                    tension_volume:         `Nowhere real — just enroll the maximum 320 and the conflict disappears`,
                    tension_price:          `Price only — charge less to be “accessible” and accept the margin will not clear`,
                    tension_none:           `There is no conflict — humanistic and profitable are the same thing automatically`,

                    r2_framing_label:       `Choose the governing framing for “Líderes con Propósito”.`,
