                    r2_cohort_hint:         `Break-even ≈ 190 at MX$95,000; the MX$6M margin needs ≈ 253; rooms and faculty cap a single cohort at 320. A framing must realistically support the size you forecast.`,
                    framing_humanistic:     `Humanistic / purpose — leaders as whole persons; smaller, mission-aligned, higher willingness-to-pay audience`,
