                    r4_board_label:         `Pitch to the board: how do you defend commercial viability?`,
                    r4_faculty_label:       `Pitch to the senior faculty: how do you hold the mission-guardians?`,
                    r4_coherence_label:     `Coherence check — does what the program DOES match what the framing SAYS?`,
                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly do you hold that a credibly humanistic design IS the commercial advantage? (0–100)`,
