                    insight_resilient:      `Viable and authentically humanistic: you resolved the dual-objective problem the way Arandia argues it must be — a purpose framing at a defensible premium, a balanced costed coaching ratio, and a coherent design the faculty will stand behind. The mission funded itself instead of fighting the margin.`,
                    insight_commercialised: `You commercialised away the differentiation. An ROI/volume design or a faculty walkout stripped out the mission-based advantage that justified the premium — leaving a generic program competing on price with cheaper online providers, which is the one fight ICL cannot win.`,
