                    insight_short:          `The mission–margin trade-off isn't yet resolved. Your framing, coaching ratio and defence still tell slightly different stories — enough for either the board or the faculty to find the seam.`,
                    insight_margin_loss:    `Your first-cohort margin is negative: either the room never filled, the price was set below what clears the budget, or an uncosted coaching ratio ate the P&L. The board's MX$6M mandate is unmet and a 2027 slip looms.`,
                    insight_margin_hit:     `You cleared the MX$6M margin mandate — and did it without hollowing out the mission. That's the proof that value-based pricing into a purpose-led audience can make the humanistic design the commercially stronger one.`,
