                    insight_underenrolled:  `Enrollment came in below the ~190 break-even. No design, however humanistic, clears a budget from an empty room — the framing, price or marketing didn't convert the audience you needed.`,
                    insight_valuepricing:   `The counter-intuitive lesson landed: purpose-aligned buyers sustained a premium, so the mission-faithful program was also the more commercially robust one — exactly the value-based-pricing result.`,

